      "run": 5,
      "steps": 12,
      "narrative": "In the world of text-based adventure games, I am a helpful assistant guiding a player through a series of interactable environments. Today, I've assisted a traveler in a cramped galley, where salt permeated every surface. There was a kettle on the floor, but it couldn't be opened. The player then examined the northward doorway and a hatch leading down to the south. After making their way to the cistern below, they found a tin cup and used it to sip water from the cryptic kettle that had appeared at some point. Eventually, the player returned to the galley and opened the kettle once more. I am designed to help players solve problems and explore the world in search of solutions, and today, I aided in unraveling the mystery of that peculiar kettle.",
